### Testing Checklist

**Basic CRUD:**
- [ ] POST /api/users - Create user
- [ ] GET /api/users - Get all users
- [ ] GET /api/users/:id - Get single user
- [ ] PUT /api/users/:id - Update user
- [ ] DELETE /api/users/:id - Soft delete

**Status Management:**
- [ ] GET /api/users/:id/status - Get status
- [ ] POST /api/users/:id/status?action=disable - Disable
- [ ] POST /api/users/:id/status?action=enable - Enable
- [ ] POST /api/users/:id/status?action=deactivate - Deactivate
- [ ] POST /api/users/:id/status?action=activate - Activate
- [ ] POST /api/users/:id/status?action=restore - Restore

**Delete Operations:**
- [ ] DELETE /api/users/:id (soft)
- [ ] DELETE /api/users/:id?permanent=true (hard)
- [ ] POST /api/users/:id/status?action=restore

**Bulk Operations:**
- [ ] POST /api/users/bulk (disable)
- [ ] POST /api/users/bulk (softDelete)

**Cleanup:**
- [ ] DELETE /api/users/cleanup?daysOld=30

**Edge Cases:**
- [ ] Create duplicate email (should fail)
- [ ] Update deleted user (should fail)
- [ ] Update disabled user (should fail)
- [ ] Get non-existent user (404)
- [ ] Invalid email format (400)